    "key_moment_beat_id": "SC-001-B6",
    "summary": "Nila returns a borrowed paperback minutes after closing; Arjun makes her open it. Nila wants to hand back the book and leave without feeling anything. Arjun wants to get through closing without a scene. Pride and fear. Each is waiting for the other to speak first, and both are hiding behind small talk. She does not answer his question. She takes the ticket, leaves the book, and turns the sign to OPEN on her way out.",
    "tone": "Restrained, patient, observant",
    "visual_motifs": [
      "Shelves and counter as barriers between them",
      "Distance that closes only when they speak",
      "A still room while the rain moves"
    ]
  },
